SECTION 3. TWO-STAGE LEAST SQUARES (2SLS / IV)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model specification
-------------------
Estimator:              2SLS / IV
Dependent variable:     y
Exogenous regressors:   x1
Endogenous regressors:  x2
Excluded instruments:   z
Intercept:              Included
Sample size:            1000
Reference models:       closed-form projection estimator; linearmodels.IV2SLS
Benchmark objective:    Structural coefficient parity under aligned IV specification
Benchmark-data note
-------------------
This is a controlled benchmark IV specification intended to assess numerical reproduction of standard 2SLS outputs under aligned assumptions rather than substantive inference on a real-world empirical application.
First-stage and identification note
-----------------------------------
The endogenous regressor x2 is instrumented using z, conditional on the included exogenous regressor x1 and the intercept.
The excluded instrument provides the variation used for structural identification in this benchmark specification.
